    "detailed_description": "<i>What is reality and what is hallucination?... I can't say anymore.</i><br>Anthony Smith is looking for help with a broken-down car at a nearby hotel. In a twist of events, he wakes up to a reality in which he fights to free his mind and soul.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Find out what happened!</h2>Relive the most important memories of your life. They hide a lot more than you think!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510170/extras/584a8bf409f0ea70406d52f5631c0646.poster.avif?t=1748949590\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510170/extras/584a8bf409f0ea70406d52f5631c0646.webm?t=1748949590\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510170/extras/584a8bf409f0ea70406d52f5631c0646.mp4?t=1748949590\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >You're Not Alone!</h2>Scary sounds, moving objects, or visions are not the only things stuck in your memories. Be careful!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510170/extras/f82521677766efba8bfeac1d5b1060ff.poster.avif?t=1748949590\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510170/extras/f82521677766efba8bfeac1d5b1060ff.webm?t=1748949590\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510170/extras/f82521677766efba8bfeac1d5b1060ff.mp4?t=1748949590\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore the Environment!</h2>Explore abandoned rooms to find medkits and batteries. Trust me, you'll need them!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510170/extras/5b2428199a78325df7f87346b263516d.poster.avif?t=1748949590\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510170/extras/5b2428199a78325df7f87346b263516d.webm?t=1748949590\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510170/extras/5b2428199a78325df7f87346b263516d.mp4?t=1748949590\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<i>What is reality and what is hallucination?... I can't say anymore.</i><br>Anthony Smith is looking for help with a broken-down car at a nearby hotel. In a twist of events, he wakes up to a reality in which he fights to free his mind and soul.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Find out what happened!</h2>Relive the most important memories of your life. They hide a lot more than you think!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510170/extras/584a8bf409f0ea70406d52f5631c0646.poster.avif?t=1748949590\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510170/extras/584a8bf409f0ea70406d52f5631c0646.webm?t=1748949590\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510170/extras/584a8bf409f0ea70406d52f5631c0646.mp4?t=1748949590\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >You're Not Alone!</h2>Scary sounds, moving objects, or visions are not the only things stuck in your memories. Be careful!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510170/extras/f82521677766efba8bfeac1d5b1060ff.poster.avif?t=1748949590\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510170/extras/f82521677766efba8bfeac1d5b1060ff.webm?t=1748949590\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510170/extras/f82521677766efba8bfeac1d5b1060ff.mp4?t=1748949590\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore the Environment!</h2>Explore abandoned rooms to find medkits and batteries. Trust me, you'll need them!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510170/extras/5b2428199a78325df7f87346b263516d.poster.avif?t=1748949590\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510170/extras/5b2428199a78325df7f87346b263516d.webm?t=1748949590\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510170/extras/5b2428199a78325df7f87346b263516d.mp4?t=1748949590\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
